          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ઇનકાર — inkār — \"a refusal\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "દુકાનદારે પૈસા પાછા આપવાનો ઇનકાર કર્યો. dukāndāre paisā pāchā āpvāno inkār karyo. The shopkeeper refused to give the money back."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "A masculine noun."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ઇનકાર (inkār) is usually traced to Arabic inkār, \"denial\", through Persian."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
